%% Diagram 3: Fluxo de autenticação (sequência)
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário
  participant LC as LoginComponent
  participant API as apiService
  participant BE as Backend
  participant AUTH as AuthContext
  U->>LC: submete credenciais
  LC->>API: POST /auth/login
  API->>BE: requisição HTTP
  BE-->>API: retorna {accessToken, refreshToken}
  LC->>AUTH: AUTH.login(tokens)
  AUTH->>LocalStorage: set token / refreshToken
  AUTH->>API: GET /auth/me (getMe)
  API->>BE: requisição HTTP
  BE-->>API: user data
  AUTH->>Socket: conecta via socket.io (auth token)
  AUTH-->>Router: push /admin

